    "tree_id": "4c78a5a707f905d6e0a9ba620842ff5a7700ec21",
    "message": "fix(app): 点进直播间必闪退 —— LoadControl 缓冲参数违反 ExoPlayer 断言\n\n根因（MuMu 模拟器 logcat）：\n  IllegalArgumentException: minBufferMs cannot be less than bufferForPlaybackAfterRebufferMs\n  at DefaultLoadControl$Builder.setBufferDurationsMs\n  at PlayerHolder.buildLoadControl(PlayerHolder.kt:132)\n\n原来传的是 min=bufferMs / afterRebuffer=bufferMs*2，恒违反\nminBufferMs >= bufferForPlaybackAfterRebufferMs >= bufferForPlaybackMs。\n改为按 maxBuffer 推导四个值，并包 runCatching 兜底：参数再错也只退回默认缓冲，不闪退。\n\n另：APK 只出 arm64-v8a 单包（isUniversalApk=false），不再出 v7a / universal；\nApp 名称改为 DC Live。",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-29T05:58:59Z",
    "author": {
      "name": "yejoe",
      "email": "1065148485@qq.com"
    },
    "committer": {
      "name": "yejoe",
      "email": "1065148485@qq.com"
    }
  },
